license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Mods for the official Insaniquarium! Deluxe (Steam, version 1.1): a ddraw.dll proxy loader with a hooking framework
  and a C mod API, plus mods for online co-op (lockstep, through a self-hosted Nakama server or Steam), extra modes,
  achievements, mutators and window choices. Contains no game code or data.
keywords:
  - game modding
  - Insaniquarium
  - PopCap
  - DLL injection
  - lockstep multiplayer
  - game preservation
